title: Reduced funding
subtitle: The 05 Council has slashed our funding.
on-arrival: ethics_hate += 1; funds_income -= 1; hate_timer += 2
tags: event
view-if: ethics_hate >= 1 and ethics_committee_relation < 40 and hate_timer = 0
priority: -1

Our continued misconduct has again led the Committee to inform the Council about it.

The 05 Council is continuously displeased, our funds have been cut off until we provide justification and enforce stricter conduct in our facilities.

The 05 warns that continued misconduct will lead to the termination of your tenure.
